==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.24.0|
* No longer grants {{c|mod|20% less Lightning Damage taken}}.
* Now grants {{c|mod|+5% to maximum Lightning Resistance}}
* Now grants {{c|mod|+40% to Lightning Resistance}} (from 50%).
}}
{{Version history table row|3.16.0|
*Now last '''8''' seconds (previously 5).
* There are changes on utility flask mod pools. Read {{section link|Version 3.16.0|Flask}} for details.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.15.0|
* The {{il|Ruby Flask|Ruby}}, {{il|Sapphire Flask|Sapphire}}, and '''Topaz Flasks''' now last 5 seconds (previously 4). They now consume 20 of 50 Charges on use (previously 30 of 60).
* Upon completing {{ql|The Key to Freedom}}, you are now offered a choice of the following rewards: {{il|Ruby Flask}}, {{il|Sapphire Flask}}, '''Topaz Flask''', {{il|Amethyst Flask}}, {{il|Diamond Flask}}, {{il|Granite Flask}}, or {{il|Jade Flask}}.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.5.0|
* No longer grant added maximum resistances. Instead, reduce the damage taken of the elements by 20%.
}}
{{Version history table row|2.2.0|
* Duration increased from 3.5 to 4 seconds. Maximum resistance reduced from 10% to 6%.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.9.13b|
* Now display an effect on your character when being used.
}}
{{Version history table row|0.9.13b|rel=before|
* Introduced to the game.
}}
{{Version history table end}}
